# Phase 5 CLI acceptance — cross-surface parity gate (D-16/SC3).
#
# Segment 2 of 2 (host-backed, D-13): the segment-1 import has reached its
# host-owned terminal state. Activating, then proving the typed-tool verb
# emits the serialized `ToolResult` with its `research_checksum` (the CLI
# leg of `crates/cli/tests/parity_cross_surface.rs`).

```console
$ qai quran activate test-edition-min@0.1.0 --yes
activated test-edition-min@0.1.0 (generation 1)

```

